ttl.description:
Time specified in milliseconds of how long the delivery report is supposed to live. Max value: 28800000. Default value: 14400000. Applicable to all callback modes except for "None".<p>Example for mode Profile</p><pre><code>[
 	{
		"callback": {
			"mode": "Profile" 
		}
	}
]</code></pre><p>Example for mode URL</p><pre><code>[
 	{
		"callback": {
			"mode": "URL",
			"urls": ["URL"], 
			"ttl": 0 
		}
	}
]</code></pre><p>Example for mode Gate</p><pre><code>[
 	{
		"callback": {
			"mode": "Gate",
			"gateId": "fb8eac56-4311-4f09-94b9-54f4bee0acb6", 
			"ttl": 0 
		}
	}
]</code></pre>
